# Dialogue quality fixes (all flags default off). A is the current show.
# FAST: the panelist the human named answers first, the panel prompt points at what the
# human just said, and each line is asked to carry one concrete fact. About +0.6 s on the
# slowest lines in our live A/B.
# FULL: FAST plus 4 candidate lines per turn, keeping the most specific one (about +1.7 s).
# FAST2: FAST plus a leaner free-floor think prompt and a persona reminder next to the line (Think & Action).
# On the dev benchmark the lean prompt raised listening from 36 to 50 and persona from 66 to 71; FAST2 is the
# recommended set for Think & Action (eval/DIALOGUE_QUALITY.md).
A    TALKSHOW_ADDRESSEE_FLOOR=0
FAST TALKSHOW_ADDRESSEE_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_UPTAKE_PLANNER=lite TALKSHOW_PANEL_SCAFFOLD_FIX=1 TALKSHOW_DIALOGUE_LIBRARY=panel_concrete TALKSHOW_PANEL_CONCRETE=1
FAST2 TALKSHOW_ADDRESSEE_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_UPTAKE_PLANNER=lite TALKSHOW_PANEL_SCAFFOLD_FIX=1 TALKSHOW_DIALOGUE_LIBRARY=panel_concrete TALKSHOW_PANEL_CONCRETE=1 TALKSHOW_THINK_LEAN=1 TALKSHOW_THINK_PERSONA_NEAR=1
# DEMO: FAST2 with the persona library (Ryan and Amy, talk-show v2 cards), forced addressee, varied openers, the decision-model floor
# pick, lines of at most 2 sentences, 3 candidate lines with the decision model picking one, the shared show
# frame (a live talk show, not a debate) and the fact pack. Needs TYPESAFE_API_KEY for the floor pick (else the LLM controller decides) and
# TALKSHOW_FACT_PACK=<fact pack json>. See eval/DIALOGUE_QUALITY.md, "Demo configuration".
DEMO TALKSHOW_ADDRESSEE_FLOOR=force TALKSHOW_UPTAKE_PLANNER=lite TALKSHOW_PANEL_SCAFFOLD_FIX=1 TALKSHOW_DIALOGUE_LIBRARY=panel_concrete TALKSHOW_PANEL_CONCRETE=1 TALKSHOW_THINK_LEAN=1 TALKSHOW_THINK_PERSONA_NEAR=1 TALKSHOW_PERSONA_LIBRARY=1 TALKSHOW_PERSONA_COMMENTATOR=ryan_skeptic_v2 TALKSHOW_PERSONA_GUEST=amy_warm_v2 TALKSHOW_OPENER_VARIETY=1 TALKSHOW_FLOOR_JEV=1 TALKSHOW_FLOOR_JEV_MIN_CONF=0.5 TALKSHOW_MAX_SENTENCES=2 TALKSHOW_PANEL_SELECT=3 TALKSHOW_SHOW_FRAME=1 TALKSHOW_HOST_CARD=1
FULL TALKSHOW_ADDRESSEE_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_UPTAKE_PLANNER=lite TALKSHOW_PANEL_SCAFFOLD_FIX=1 TALKSHOW_DIALOGUE_LIBRARY=panel_concrete TALKSHOW_PANEL_CONCRETE=1 TALKSHOW_PANEL_BEST_OF=4
